T1  - Acute effects of Mozart K.448 on interictal epileptiform discharges in adult patients with drug-resistant focal epilepsy: A crossover randomized controlled trial
AU  - Tosamran, Somjet
AU  - Pakotiprapha, Thanaporn
AU  - Asavalertpalakorn, Thtiwat
AU  - Kiatprungvech, Thanakorn
AU  - Surawattanawong, Totsapol
