T1  - New Perspectives in Psychopathology and Psychological Well-being by Using Forest Therapy: A Systematic Review
AU  - Caponnetto, Pasquale
AU  - Inguscio, Lucio
AU  - Triscari, Sergio
AU  - Casu, Mirko
