T1  - Management of Dyspnea and Anxiety in Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease: A Critical Review
AU  - Yohannes, Abebaw Mengistu
AU  - Junkes-Cunha, Maira
AU  - Smith, Jacky
AU  - Vestbo, Jorgen
