T1  - A Synthesized Model for Applying Stress Management and Biofeedback Interventions in Research Utilization: A Systematic Review and Meta-analysis
AU  - Ruchiwit, Manyat
AU  - Vuthiarpa, Sararud
AU  - Ruchiwit, Kampol
AU  - Muijeen, Kasorn
AU  - Phanphairoj, Kanjanee
